Changelog v1.1.0

* Added a custom Navigation Bar.
* Added an option to hide the navigation bar in Shorts.
* Introduced a Local Playback Queue.
* Added options to hide action buttons below and inside the player for a cleaner interface.
* Added support for custom download locations and improved playlist detection.
* Moved the Picture-in-Picture (PiP) button below the player.
* Fixed an issue where the Next and Previous buttons did not work in PiP mode.
* Fixed aspect ratio stretching when switching between PiP and Fullscreen modes.
* Merged session authentication and optimized the JavaScript engine.
* Improved timestamp click handling.
* Added Hold-to-2x-Speed gesture for Shorts.
* Added separate toggles for player gestures.
* Merged mini-player.
* Implemented a rotate gesture to enter Fullscreen mode.
* Added a drag-down gesture to enter mini-player.
* Overhauled the playlist downloader and stream extractor.
* Added multiple theme improvements.
* Improved download resume functionality.
* Fixed duplicate audio track issues.
* Added and updated missing translations.
* The app now automatically uses your device language by default.
* Added the ability to customize the double-tap seek duration.
* Fixed the persistent status bar issue in Fullscreen mode.
* Removed the Watch Page header for a cleaner viewing experience.
* Fixed external link handling(remember signed in state).
* Fixed an issue where the back button did not work correctly in WebView.
* Improved the captions toggle experience.
* Fixed download notification issues.
* Added network speed and ETA indicators for downloads.
* Added action buttons to download notifications.
* Added an Undo Skip option for SponsorBlock.
* Added support for playing downloads and device videos in the in-app player.
* Added remaining playback duration in the player.
* Added a dedicated Downloads tab to download videos without opening the app.
* Fixed incorrect durations in downloaded videos.
* Added an option to set the maximum number of concurrent downloads.
* Added support for downloading videos directly from copied links.
* Added a fully functional Incognito Mode.
* Limited gestures to the middle 3/5th area of the screen.
* Added a toggle for the long-press context menu.
* Refined back-press handling for YouTube containers.
* Added a toggle for search suggestions.
* Synced watch history and playback position between the native player and WebView player.
* Added tutorial for opening links by default.
* Added toggle for shorts player buttons.
* Added options to hide comments bar below player.
* Added 200% volume boost feature to player.
* Added Innertube as a fallback extractor.